---
import User from "./icons/User.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="py-10 md:py-16">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <h2 class="text-lg md:text-[30px] font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-1">
      <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-variable to-statusbar-bg">
        Sobre Mí
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-400 text-sm">Formación, experiencia y lo que me mueve</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-editor-bg/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl border border-white/5 relative">
    <div class="bg-editor-bg p-2 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-sidebar-bg/50 rounded-t-xl">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></span>
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 ml-2 flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <User class="w-3 h-3 text-variable" />
        about.ts
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 md:p-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
        <div class="lg:w-2/3 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-sm md:text-md leading-relaxed text-text-default">
            Soy <span class="text-variable font-medium">George Contreras</span>, Tecnólogo en Desarrollo de Software egresado de la Universidad de Cundinamarca (2024). Me especializo en <span class="text-boolean">Frontend</span> con el ecosistema JavaScript, aunque también desarrollo en Backend cuando el proyecto lo requiere.
          </p>

          <p class="text-sm md:text-md leading-relaxed text-text-default">
            Me gusta construir interfaces que se sientan rápidas, limpias y funcionales. Siempre estoy aprendiendo algo nuevo y buscando retos que me hagan crecer.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-sidebar-bg/80 text-xs font-medium text-text-default rounded-lg border border-sidebar-bg">
              <span class="text-boolean">const</span> stack = [<span class="text-string">"React"</span>, <span class="text-string">"Next.js"</span>, <span class="text-string">"Tailwind"</span>]
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              href="#projects"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-gray-800/50 hover:bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-700/50 hover:border-blue-500/30"
            >
              Ver mis proyectos →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 about-avatar lg:-mr-10 lg:translate-x-2 lg:-mt-4">
          <div class="relative group">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full transition-all duration-300 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-object-global to-keyword opacity-0  blur-md"></div>
            <img
              src="/logo/Logo.webp"
              alt="George Contreras - Desarrollador Web"
              class="relative z-20 w-36 h-36 rounded-full border-4 border-sidebar-bg shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <h3 class="text-lg text-text-default font-semibold">George Contreras</h3>
            <p class="text-variable text-sm">Frontend Developer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>